[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 40926.23, "timestamp": "11:22:06", "text": "這段"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 40926.633, "timestamp": "11:22:06", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "get your meter checked"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 40928.55, "timestamp": "11:22:08", "text": "程式碼無法運行，任何程式都無法運行，因為網路佔用率達到了 100%。如果你查看任務管理器，你會發現網路佔用率也達到了 100%，因為它已經耗盡，沒有太多空間可以運作。後來"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 40938.552, "timestamp": "11:22:18", "author": "@soulofswords", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/N5UGOOCkqJY6i3x846X2nx9EjZpP3SAIdAeuPAjxPPdNLWmO1Oi53_c__BkFrKVpJqviVQ07=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "for me 1bhk before gaming pc it was Rs.1200/- now after it's Rs.1800/-"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 40974.55, "timestamp": "11:22:54", "text": "我意識到我需要購買一塊網卡。為此，我需要一塊主機板，它有兩個 PCI Express x16 或 x4 插槽，就像擷取卡一樣。你需要購買一塊內建網卡，然後把"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 40976.266, "timestamp": "11:22:56", "author": "@soulofswords", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/N5UGOOCkqJY6i3x846X2nx9EjZpP3SAIdAeuPAjxPPdNLWmO1Oi53_c__BkFrKVpJqviVQ07=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "now that leaves with. what heavy appliance do u have ?"}]